# 📦 Dependencies (Prevents uploading thousands of package files)
**/node_modules/

# 🔒 Secrets & Keys (Keeps your database passwords and API keys 100% private)
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.production
**/.env.development
**/.env.*
*.env

# 🚀 Build Outputs (Prevents uploading compiled production code)
**/dist/
**/build/
**/.next/

# 🖥️ System Files (Keeps junk files out of your repository)
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log
